Absorbed multipart implementation
---------------------------------

packages/s3-sandbox/src/multipart/parser.ts and parameters.ts are adapted
from Brian White's busboy 1.6.0. byte-matcher.ts is adapted from Brian White's
streamsearch 1.1.0, which credits Hongli Lai's streaming search algorithm.

